From 277939573d3cfaef7ade70b133bceeac73f07f40 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 00:21:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Dispatch > Trip Board: non-emergency trips, patients,
 GPS, crew screen and reports

Rebuilds the ReactSolutions dispatch prototype as a Pulse module (App\Trips):
the trip board with queue, timeline, drag-and-drop assigning and live updates
by polling; patients with encrypted details; facilities; the trip map with
GPS from a webhook, Samsara or the simulator; the crew phone screen; reports,
the billing export and run sheets (audited); Trip Settings; idle sign-out on
trip pages; and trips:sample for made-up practice data.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YKT3xkgXK6qCfDX9SM5x4p
